{"unit_id":"BeiZi6__dsh-theme-plugin#card-zh","repo":"BeiZi6/dsh-theme-plugin","commit":"b3e7e143532c4b6df71da753d2336bb018949d2a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-plugin 是面向 DSH Web GUI 的主题插件，通过 Host 的 webServer.tapIndex 注入 CSS，并在设置页提供主题工作室。它内置 stock、Codex warm、Nord、Solarized、Graphite 等预设，可分别调整浅色与深色模式的强调色、背景、前景、界面字体和代码字体，也能控制侧边栏透明效果与对比度。客户端即时应用选择并保存到浏览器 localStorage，适合希望个性化 DSH 网页界面的用户；需要启用 Web profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:347-387","client.js:552-600"]}
{"unit_id":"BeiZi6__dsh-theme-plugin#card-en","repo":"BeiZi6/dsh-theme-plugin","commit":"b3e7e143532c4b6df71da753d2336bb018949d2a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-theme-plugin adds a Theme Studio to the DSH Web GUI, injecting CSS through webServer.tapIndex. Choose five presets or customize colors, fonts, sidebar translucency, and contrast. Changes apply immediately and persist in browser localStorage. Requires the Web profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:347-387","client.js:552-600"]}
